---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
import LeafletMap from '../components/LeafletMap.astro';
import heroContact from '../assets/site/hero-contacto.jpg';
import contactPattern from '../assets/site/contact-background.webp';

const introduction = 'Cuéntanos tu proyecto y nuestro equipo te ofrecerá un acompañamiento profesional desde el primer contacto, con soluciones claras y a medida para tu obra, reforma o rehabilitación.';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Contacto | HUCA Building Solutions"
  description={introduction}
  ogImage={heroContact}
  noindex={true}
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Inicio', href: '/' }, { label: 'Contacto' }]}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Te apoyamos en cada etapa"
    title="Contacto"
    description={introduction}
    image={heroContact}
    imageAlt="Oficinas renovadas con mamparas acristaladas y espacios de trabajo."
    breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Inicio', href: '/' }, { label: 'Contacto' }]}
  />

  <section class="contact-section section-pad" style={`--contact-pattern: url("${contactPattern.src}")`}>
    <div class="container contact-section__grid">
      <div class="contact-section__information">
        <SectionHeading eyebrow="Trabajemos juntos" title="Contacta con nosotros" />
        <p class="contact-section__intro">
          En HUCA, ofrecemos un acompañamiento profesional desde el primer contacto. Si tienes en marcha una obra nueva, una reforma integral o un proyecto de rehabilitación, estamos a tu disposición para estudiarlo con rigor y ofrecerte una solución a medida.
        </p>
        <p class="contact-section__note">Te escuchamos, analizamos tus necesidades y te respondemos con claridad.</p>

        <div class="contact-people">
          <article class="contact-person">
            <h3>Diego Huelin</h3>
            <a href="tel:+34671774262">671.774.262</a>
            <span>8.00 - 17.00</span>
            <a href="mailto:dhuelin@hucaconstructora.com">dhuelin@hucaconstructora.com</a>
          </article>
          <article class="contact-person">
            <h3>Arnau Lopez</h3>
            <a href="tel:+34663275750">663.275.750</a>
            <span>9.00 - 13.00</span>
            <a href="mailto:alopez@hucaconstructora.com">alopez@hucaconstructora.com</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-section__form">
        <ContactForm />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-map" aria-label="Ubicación de HUCA">
    <LeafletMap lat={41.2701} lng={1.9819} zoom={16} tileStyle="positron" />
    <aside class="contact-map__card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Visítanos</p>
      <address>Av. de la Pineda, 2<br />08860 Castelldefels, Barcelona</address>
      <a
        href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Av.%20de%20la%20Pineda%2C%202%2C%2008860%20Castelldefels%2C%20Barcelona"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >Abrir en Google Maps <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </aside>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .contact-section {
    background-color: #fafafa;
    background-image: var(--contact-pattern);
    background-position: right bottom;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-size: min(700px, 60%) auto;
  }

  .contact-section__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(38px, 6vw, 84px);
  }

  .contact-section__information {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .contact-section__intro,
  .contact-section__note {
    color: var(--color-copy);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .contact-section__note {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .contact-people {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .contact-person {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 8px;
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .contact-person h3 {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .contact-person a {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-person a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
  }

  .contact-person span {
    color: var(--color-copy);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .contact-section__form {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .contact-map {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(360px, 45vw, 560px);
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--color-charcoal);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-map .leaflet-map {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .contact-map :global(.leaflet-tile-pane) {
    filter: grayscale(1) brightness(1.15) contrast(0.7) saturate(0.15);
  }

  .contact-map :global(.leaflet-container) {
    filter: grayscale(1) brightness(1.15) contrast(0.7) saturate(0.15);
  }

  .contact-map__card {
    z-index: 40;
  }

  .contact-map__card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: max(var(--page-gutter), calc((100vw - var(--container)) / 2));
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    width: min(320px, calc(100% - 48px));
    padding: 20px;
    background: white;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .contact-map__card address {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .contact-map__card a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .contact-map__card a span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-section__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact-section__information {
      max-width: 760px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .contact-people {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact-map {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
